description:
We currently have a vacancy for a Functional Business Analyst fluent in English, to offer his/her services as an expert who will be based in Stockholm. The work will be carried out either in the company’s premises or on site at customer premises. In the context of the first assignment, the successful candidate will be integrated in the Analysis team of the company that will closely cooperate with a major client’s IT team on site.

Your tasks:

Gather and document business requirements and assist stakeholders in prioritizing requirements;

Conduct feasibility and related studies and perform stakeholder analysis;

Create and maintain technical and user documentation as well as document standard operating procedures (in cooperation with the Quality Assurance team);

Perform business data modelling, analyse and improve business processes;

Produce and maintain Business Analysis outputs, including use cases, requirements, mock-ups, user stories and other UML diagrams;

Participate in Agile development and assist with system configuration during deployment;

Specify the user interfaces and develop use cases, test cases and contribute to testing;

Prepare training material and conduct user training;

Assist in the development and implementation of standards.

requirements:
Your skills:

University degree with minimum 4 years of professional experience in IT or non-university degree with minimum 6 years of experience in IT;

Minimum 3 years of experience in business analysis, gathering and analysing requirements for applications using UML, Agile and Scrum;

Experience in process modelling and modelling of functional and non-functional requirements;

Hands on experience with testing applications and training users;

Knowledge of Microsoft Office applications such as Word, Excel and Outlook and with MS SharePoint application development and MS Dynamics CRM;

Knowledge of MS Team Foundation Server (TFS) and MS Project will be considered an asset;

Excellent command of English, both written and oral.

