description:
Strategic Partnerships is the team that oversees partners' relations in Massive Media. This team is responsible for managing current partners' commercial relations and develop new business with them, and close new strategic deals that drive revenues and provide added value to Massive Media's businesses, products and services.

The role includes :

Business development with existing and potential partners (research, cold calling, pitching, preparing proposal, meeting, closing deal, discussing contract, follow up);

key account management;

contracts' negotiations - add strategic value to the team through research, reporting and feedback.

