Bachelor or Masters degree;

experience: 1-3 years in advertising/media/online business in marketing/sales/business development position, some international experience is a plus;

passionate about media and online business;

business minded and passionate about finding new revenue streams and business models;

confident in meetings and presentations;

familiar with contracts, contractual negotiations and/or sales, experience and results in closing deals;

