Function

To support our further growth, we’re looking for a dedicated, bright and enthusiastic Financial Analyst who will be responsible for:

Monthly analysis and reporting of financial and operational performance metrics;

Ensure data integrity;

Develop and perform business modeling/business planning for existing and/or new revenue streams, products, and profit centers;

Perform varied analysis of an economic and business nature

Compiling of performance reports for the different teams;

Ensuring forecasts are delivered on time, accurately and as agreed with stakeholders;

Recalculation of costs and revenues;

Internal control.

Skills and Experience

You hold a Masters degree in Economics, Mathematics or Computer Sciences, an MBA is a plus;

You are analytical, precise, well organised and a quick learner;

You have a good understanding of business processes and drivers of business result;

You are a real Excel-expert with preferably some programming knowledge e.g. in VBA;

You have experience in the ongoing optimization of processes, interfaces and systems;

In depth knowledge of US GAAP;

Experience with Microsoft Dynamics GP (formerly Great Plains) and Oracle Hyperion is a plus;

Perfect English.

