We currently have a vacancy for JAVA/J2EE developer fluent in English, to offer his/her services as an expert who will be based in Brussels. The work will be carried out either in the company’s premises or on site at the customer premises. In the context of the first assignment, the successful candidate will be integrated into the development team of the company that will closely cooperate with a major client’s IT team on site.

